2. Parent–Child Relationship
- MaterialApp: Main application widget.
- MyApp: Custom widget that builds the main screen.
- Scaffold: Provides the basic screen structure.
- AppBar: Displays the top app bar.
- Text: Displays the title User Greeting.
- Center: Places its child in the center of the screen.
- UserGreeting: Custom widget created in user_greeting.dart.
- Text: Displays Hello, Flutter Learner!.
